060a12;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">If you didn&#x27;t sign up for OpenAudioHub, you can safely ignore this message.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:24px 20px;border-top:1px solid #d8dfe9;background-color:#f3f7fc;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#636974;margin:0 0 8px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">OpenAudioHub · Self-hosted AI transcription and summaries for Plaud recordings.</p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#636974;margin:0 0 8px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://github.com/JeremyL691/OpenAudioHub" style="color:#101723;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Source code</a> · OpenAudioHub contributors · Based on Riffado (AGPL-3.0)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"`;
